      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 5.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "well hi doctor I hope I'm not disturbing you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.0,
      "end_seconds": 11.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Not at all please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.61,
      "end_seconds": 29.38,
      "duration_seconds": 16.77,
      "text": "yeah, it's slurred speech i don't know what's causing it i took the morning off to come in today i've been reading about it online and it worried me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.37,
      "end_seconds": 36.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "right can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.73,
      "end_seconds": 44.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.02,
      "end_seconds": 62.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 74, pressure 163 over 93, saturation 99 percent, temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.03,
      "end_seconds": 65.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.8,
      "end_seconds": 72.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly. Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.34,
      "end_seconds": 75.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "About... well six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.04,
      "end_seconds": 80.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.44,
      "end_seconds": 91.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "I'd say moderate. There was my face drooping on one side yes but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.95,
      "end_seconds": 97.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "have you had slurred speech before or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.16,
      "end_seconds": 111.21,
      "duration_seconds": 12.05,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so yes, something like this happened about six months ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.84,
      "end_seconds": 116.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "any seizure, fever or loss of consciousness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.73,
      "end_seconds": 121.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "no, you know, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.2,
      "end_seconds": 124.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.08,
      "end_seconds": 129.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Right, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.94,
      "end_seconds": 150.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.87,
      "end_seconds": 154.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "my grandmother had dementia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.87,
      "end_seconds": 159.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.11,
      "end_seconds": 164.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "High blood pressure for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.88,
      "end_seconds": 168.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.47,
      "end_seconds": 174.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Yes I had a varicose vein procedure last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.86,
      "end_seconds": 189.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.78,
      "end_seconds": 193.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.57,
      "end_seconds": 196.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.59,
      "end_seconds": 203.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.87,
      "end_seconds": 206.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.74,
      "end_seconds": 210.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.12,
      "end_seconds": 215.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.35,
      "end_seconds": 221.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "No I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.34,
      "end_seconds": 224.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.28,
      "end_seconds": 229.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "No, um, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.77,
      "end_seconds": 240.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "going by what you've described, I can't pin this down yet we're looking at a possible stroke, within the treatment window or a migraine with aura"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.16,
      "end_seconds": 243.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.3,
      "end_seconds": 255.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.85,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible stroke, within the treatment window is my leading thought, not anything worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.94,
      "end_seconds": 283.95,
      "duration_seconds": 18.01,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a blood sugar test for stroke symptoms. I'd rather check than guess and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like to arrange an urgent CT scan of the head for possible stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.82,
      "end_seconds": 289.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Erm, how long will it it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.32,
      "end_seconds": 295.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Call an ambulance now you need hospital immediately."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.83,
      "end_seconds": 306.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.94,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. I think the stroke team should see you too. Please don't wait if the symptoms change. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.14,
      "end_seconds": 314.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "thank you, um, that's clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.94,
      "end_seconds": 318.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "please come and see me straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.84,
      "end_seconds": 320.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.47,
      "end_seconds": 324.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "alright that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
